---
// Each capability pairs plausible enterprise copy with a small system exhibit
// whose data quietly contradicts the promise.
---

<section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:py-28">
		<div class="reveal max-w-2xl">
			<p class="eyebrow">Platform capabilities</p>
			<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl">
				A complete accountability stack.
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-5 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
				Four subsystems, one guarantee: responsibility always resolves.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="reveal mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
			<!-- Ownership Inference™ -->
			<article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Ownership Inference™</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 flex-none text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Responsibility is inferred from behavior, not org charts. The model weighs the
					signals that actually predict action.
				</p>
				<div class="exhibit mt-5 flex-1 bg-surface p-5">
					<p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.16em] text-muted uppercase">Signal weights</p>
					<dl class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-soft">
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>follow-up frequency</dt><dd class="tabular-nums">0.31</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>context retention</dt><dd class="tabular-nums">0.27</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>deadline awareness</dt><dd class="tabular-nums">0.19</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>uncomfortable questions asked</dt><dd class="tabular-nums">0.14</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>probability of doing it anyway</dt><dd class="tabular-nums">0.09</dd></div>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- Shared Ownership™ -->
			<article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Shared Ownership™</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 flex-none text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Let entire teams own outcomes collectively. Ask “who's supposed to follow up on
					this?” and receive a definitive, documented answer: the team.
				</p>
				<div class="exhibit mt-5 flex-1 bg-surface p-5">
					<p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.16em] text-muted uppercase">Ownership state</p>
					<dl class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-soft">
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>owner</dt><dd>Engineering</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>accountable individual</dt><dd class="text-warn">—</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>coverage</dt><dd class="text-accent">100%</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>status</dt><dd class="text-accent">Fully covered</dd></div>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- Mental Load Balancing™ -->
			<article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Mental Load Balancing™</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 flex-none text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Continuous workload monitoring across every tracked dimension of work, so no one
					carries more than their share of what the system measures.
				</p>
				<div class="exhibit mt-5 flex-1 bg-surface p-5">
					<p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.16em] text-muted uppercase">Workload report — G.R.</p>
					<dl class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-soft">
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>assigned workload</dt><dd class="text-accent">Balanced</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>coordination workload</dt><dd class="text-warn">—</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>follow-ups in flight</dt><dd class="text-warn">—</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>context retained</dt><dd class="text-warn">—</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>status</dt><dd class="text-accent">Healthy</dd></div>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- Follow-Up Delegation™ -->
			<article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper p-6 sm:p-8">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Follow-Up Delegation™</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 flex-none text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
					Action and accountability, cleanly separated. The action owner acts. Everything
					required to make sure they act is delegated efficiently.
				</p>
				<div class="exhibit mt-5 flex-1 bg-surface p-5">
					<p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.16em] text-muted uppercase">Delegation state</p>
					<dl class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-soft">
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>action owner</dt><dd>Team Lead</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>reminder owner</dt><dd>You</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>escalation owner</dt><dd>You</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>context holder</dt><dd>You</dd></div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt>next action</dt><dd class="text-warn">Wait</dd></div>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
